{"seq":1,"slug":"normalization-hvg-model","title":"归一化、方差稳定与高变基因选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/preprocessing-annotation-pipeline/normalization-hvg-model","wordCount":2831,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"归一化-方差稳定与高变基因选择\">归一化、方差稳定与高变基因选择</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>单细胞表达矩阵的原始 UMI 计数混叠了三层与技术无关的信号。其一是<strong>测序深度</strong>：捕获 800 个 UMI 的细胞与捕获 8000 个的细胞，同一基因的原始计数天然差一个数量级，而这个差异反映文库大小而非生物学。其二是<strong>基因长度与捕获效率</strong>（对 UMI 数据主要表现为捕获效率），其三是<strong>组成偏差</strong>——当少数高表达基因（线粒体或核糖体蛋白）占据一个细胞 30% 以上计数时，其余基因的比例被机械性压低。归一化的目标，就是把这三层技术噪声从细胞间比较中剥离，只保留生物学差异。</p>\n<p>归一化不是管线的可选前置步骤，而是决定后续所有分析上限的一步。PCA、邻居图、UMAP、聚类和差异表达都建立在归一化后的矩阵上，被放大的技术方差会在降维中被当作真实结构投影出来——UMAP 上的&quot;新细胞亚群&quot;，有时只是深度差异的伪影。2026 年的主流实践收敛到两条路线：一是&quot;计数深度归一化 + log1p + 离散度选特征&quot;的经典路线，二是&quot;负二项建模 + 方差稳定残差&quot;的建模路线。两者对高变基因（Highly Variable Genes, HVG）的选择逻辑不同，适用场景也不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始 UMI 计数矩阵] --&gt; B{归一化路线}&#10;    B --&gt; C[深度归一化路线]&#10;    B --&gt; D[方差稳定路线]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[按文库大小缩放&lt;br/&gt;median 或 CP10k]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[对数变换压缩动态范围]&#10;    C2 --&gt; E1[离散度选 HVG]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[sctransform v2&lt;br/&gt;正则化负二项]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[解析皮尔逊残差]&#10;    D1 --&gt; E2[残差方差排名]&#10;    D2 --&gt; E2&#10;    C --&gt; C3[seurat_v3&lt;br/&gt;loess 方差稳定]&#10;    C3 --&gt; E2&#10;    E1 --&gt; F[缩放 + PCA]&#10;    E2 --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[原始 UMI 计数矩阵] --&gt; B{归一化路线}\n    B --&gt; C[深度归一化路线]\n    B --&gt; D[方差稳定路线]\n    C --&gt; C1[按文库大小缩放&lt;br/&gt;median 或 CP10k]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[对数变换压缩动态范围]\n    C2 --&gt; E1[离散度选 HVG]\n    D --&gt; D1[sctransform v2&lt;br/&gt;正则化负二项]\n    D --&gt; D2[解析皮尔逊残差]\n    D1 --&gt; E2[残差方差排名]\n    D2 --&gt; E2\n    C --&gt; C3[seurat_v3&lt;br/&gt;loess 方差稳定]\n    C3 --&gt; E2\n    E1 --&gt; F[缩放 + PCA]\n    E2 --&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>HVG 依据</th>\n<th>默认基因数</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>深度归一化 + log1p</td>\n<td>原始计数</td>\n<td>分箱后离散度</td>\n<td>2000（Seurat 经典）</td>\n<td>Scanpy <code>normalize_total</code> + <code>log1p</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flavor=&#39;seurat_v3&#39;</code></td>\n<td>原始计数</td>\n<td>loess 方差稳定后的标准化方差</td>\n<td>需显式指定，常用 2000</td>\n<td>Scanpy（依赖 <code>scikit-misc</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flavor=&#39;pearson_residuals&#39;</code></td>\n<td>原始计数</td>\n<td>解析皮尔逊残差方差</td>\n<td>需显式指定</td>\n<td>Scanpy <code>experimental.pp</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SCTransform</code> (SCT v2)</td>\n<td>原始计数</td>\n<td>正则化负二项残差方差</td>\n<td>3000</td>\n<td>Seurat 5.x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"测序深度归一化与对数变换\">测序深度归一化与对数变换</h2><p>最基础的归一化按每个细胞的总计数缩放。Scanpy 的 <code>sc.pp.normalize_total(adata)</code> 在每个细胞的计数上除以该细胞的文库大小，再乘以目标值。当 <code>target_sum=None</code>（默认）时目标取所有细胞总计数的<strong>中位数</strong>——用中位数而非均值，是为了让归一化本身不被少数异常深或浅的细胞主导。显式传入 <code>target_sum=1e4</code> 得到 CP10k 约定，<code>target_sum=1e6</code> 则是 CPM。目标值只影响绝对尺度，不改变基因间相对关系，对下游 PCA 无实质影响。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的参数是 <code>exclude_highly_expressed</code>：当某基因在任一细胞中的计数超过 <code>max_fraction</code>（默认 0.05）时，该基因被排除在文库大小的计算之外。这在肿瘤或应激样本中尤其重要——线粒体基因在濒死细胞中可占据过半计数，若把它们算进文库大小，其余基因会被系统性低估，这些细胞的&quot;转录组塌缩&quot;会被误读为一种独特的低表达状态。</p>\n<p>深度归一化之后通常接 <code>sc.pp.log1p</code>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log(1+x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。对数变换压缩表达量的动态范围（单细胞数据可跨越 5–6 个数量级），使方差在均值上升时不至于同步爆炸，也让后续线性方法（PCA、线性回归）在&quot;近似同方差&quot;假设下工作得更合理。但加 1 的伪计数（pseudocount）引入了系统性偏差：对低表达基因，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log(1+x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压缩其微小差异，使方差被低估。这正是&quot;方差稳定&quot;路线试图绕开的根本问题——加伪计数再取对数，本质上是在<strong>用人为变换去近似一个本应显式建模的方差结构</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方差稳定与解析皮尔逊残差\">方差稳定与解析皮尔逊残差</h2><p>方差稳定路线的核心洞察是：单细胞 UMI 计数的方差不是常数，而随均值增长，且增长速度<strong>超过</strong>泊松模型预测的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Var}=\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>。这是过离散（overdispersion）现象，源于细胞间真实表达异质性、捕获效率波动和扩增偏差。既然方差是均值的函数，就不该用固定变换抹平它，而应显式建模这个函数。</p>\n<p>Hafemeister 与 Satija 在 2019 年提出的 sctransform 用<strong>正则化负二项回归</strong>拟合每个基因的计数-深度关系。负二项分布用均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 和过离散参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 描述方差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Var}(x) = \\mu + \\frac{\\mu^2}{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时退化为泊松分布。sctransform 对每个基因拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 关于测序深度的函数得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，再计算<strong>皮尔逊残差</strong>——观测值偏离期望的标准化量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{ij} = \\frac{x_{ij} - \\mu_{ij}}{\\sqrt{\\mu_{ij} + \\mu_{ij}^2/\\theta}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9903em;vertical-align:-1.73em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1765em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1765em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1365em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6635em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4065em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1765em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8535em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1765em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.73em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>残差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的含义是&quot;细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 中基因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的表达，相对同等深度的期望偏离了几个标准差&quot;。它天然同方差化：无论基因低表达还是高表达，残差都落在可比尺度上。Seurat 5.x 中 <code>SCTransform()</code> 默认使用 SCT v2（基于 Lause 等 2021 年对 v1 的改进），把残差存入 <code>SCT$scale.data</code> 并直接作为 PCA 输入；若检测到 <code>glmGamPoi</code> 包会自动用它加速。默认选择 <strong>3000</strong> 个高变基因，高于经典工作流的 2000（来源：Satija Lab <code>sctransform_vignette</code>，Seurat 5.6.0 / sctransform 0.4.3）。</p>\n<p>Lause、Berens 与 Kobak 在 2021 年（<em>Genome Biology</em> 22:296）提出了<strong>解析皮尔逊残差</strong>，把 sctransform 的逐基因拟合简化为闭式解：不再为每个基因单独拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，而是从全部基因估计一个<strong>共享的</strong>过离散参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>（取基因间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 的一个分位数，Scanpy 默认 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>）。这牺牲了对单基因特异过离散的刻画，换来了数量级加速与免迭代的稳定性——在数十万细胞的大规模图谱上是决定性优势。Scanpy 通过 <code>sc.experimental.pp.normalize_pearson_residuals</code> 实现，默认把残差裁剪到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-\\sqrt{n_{\\text{obs}}}, \\sqrt{n_{\\text{obs}}}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0647em;vertical-align:-0.3147em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6853em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6853em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{obs}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为细胞数）以抑制极端残差的杠杆效应。该实现仍在 <code>experimental</code> 子模块下，API 可能变动，生产管线应锁定 Scanpy 版本并回归验证。（来源：Scanpy 1.12.4 文档）</p>\n<h2 id=\"高变基因选择的四种-flavor\">高变基因选择的四种 flavor</h2><p>HVG 选择的目的是降维前筛掉信息量低的基因。单细胞矩阵通常有 2 万至 3 万个基因，但大部分在所有细胞中要么恒为零，要么近乎恒定，只贡献噪声。Scanpy 的 <code>sc.pp.highly_variable_genes</code> 提供四种 flavor，对输入数据的要求截然不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>flavor=&#39;seurat&#39;</code>（默认）</strong>：离散度法。按平均表达量把基因分箱（<code>n_bins=20</code>），箱内标准化离散度后排秩。默认用切分阈值 <code>min_mean=0.0125</code>、<code>max_mean=3</code>、<code>min_disp=0.5</code>，而非固定基因数。<strong>要求输入已对数化</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>flavor=&#39;cell_ranger&#39;</code></strong>：思路同 seurat，但模仿 Cell Ranger——Cell Ranger 传 <code>n_top_genes</code> 而非切分阈值，故指定基因数时阈值被忽略。</li>\n<li><strong><code>flavor=&#39;seurat_v3&#39;</code></strong>：方差稳定法（Seurat v3 的 <code>FindVariableFeatures</code>）。用 loess 拟合方差-均值关系得到<strong>正则化方差</strong>再排秩。<strong>要求原始计数</strong>，<code>n_top_genes</code> 必填；<code>span=0.3</code> 控制平滑带宽，依赖 <code>scikit-misc</code>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>flavor=&#39;pearson_residuals&#39;</code></strong>：先算解析皮尔逊残差（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>，裁剪到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm\\sqrt{n_{\\text{obs}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.3147em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6853em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），再按残差方差排名。<strong>要求原始计数</strong>，<code>n_top_genes</code> 必填。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这里有一个极易出错的陷阱：<code>seurat</code> 和 <code>cell_ranger</code> 吃<strong>对数化后</strong>的矩阵，而 <code>seurat_v3</code> 和 <code>pearson_residuals</code> 吃<strong>原始计数</strong>。把 log1p 后的矩阵喂给 <code>seurat_v3</code> 会得到无意义的 loess 拟合，而 <code>check_values=True</code>（默认）只校验整数性，无法保证&quot;矩阵确实未经对数变换&quot;。正确顺序是：先 <code>adata.layers[&quot;counts&quot;] = adata.X.copy()</code> 保存原始计数，再做深度归一化和 log1p；若走 v3 或 Pearson 残差路线，则从 <code>layers[&quot;counts&quot;]</code> 取原始计数单独计算 HVG。</p>\n<p><code>seurat_v3_paper</code> 是第五个变体，计算与 <code>seurat_v3</code> 相同但面向多批次：它模仿 Seurat 的 <code>SelectIntegrationFeatures</code>，先按&quot;该基因在多少个批次中被判为 HVG&quot;排序，同分时取跨批次排名中位数。这与在合并池上跑一次 v3 有本质区别——后者可能选出仅在单一供体中强变异的基因，而这些往往是批次效应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批次感知的-hvg-与稳健性实践\">批次感知的 HVG 与稳健性实践</h2><p>单细胞项目很少只有一个样本。当 <code>batch_key</code> 传入时，Scanpy 的行为随 flavor 而变：对 <code>seurat</code> 与 <code>seurat_v3</code>，<code>batch_key</code> 让离散度/方差在每个批次内分别计算再取<strong>跨批次中位数</strong>，抑制批次特异的假 HVG；对 <code>seurat_v3_paper</code> 则是前面描述的&quot;批次计数优先 + 排名中位数&quot;两段式。经验规则：<strong>只要样本数 ≥2 就传 <code>batch_key</code></strong>，即使后续还会做单独的数据整合。</p>\n<p>基因数目的选择没有唯一正解，但有可用锚点：经典工作流用 2000，Seurat 的 SCTransform 默认 3000，均为经验值。太少（如 500）会丢失稀有细胞类型的标记基因，导致亚群无法分离；太多（如 5000+）会把噪声基因带入 PCA，稀释真实主成分。判断是否合理不看数字本身而看下游：<code>sc.pl.highly_variable_genes</code> 的均值-方差散点应显示选中基因落在拟合曲线上方；PCA 碎石图前几个主成分应有明显拐点，若前 50 个主成分解释方差几乎无差别，通常意味着 HVG 混入了过多噪声。</p>\n<p>一个常被低估的稳健性问题是<strong>管线间的不可比性</strong>：同一数据集用 <code>seurat</code> flavor 和 <code>pearson_residuals</code> 选出的 HVG 通常只有 60–70% 重叠。这不是 bug，而是两种&quot;什么算变异&quot;的哲学差异外显——离散度法奖励相对均值的偏离，残差法奖励相对负二项期望的偏离。因此跨数据集比较聚类结果或做整合时必须固定归一化与 HVG 方法，项目内不要混用。<code>target_sum</code> 取值虽不影响单数据集内部结论，但复现流程时会被记录进方法学部分。</p>\n<p>对空间转录组数据，归一化多一层考量：每个 spot（或 bin）捕获的是多个细胞的混合转录组，UMI 总量更高且更均匀，深度归一化影响小于单细胞。但空间平台捕获效率差异很大，跨平台整合前须格外谨慎；Xenium/CosMx 这类成像法产出的是&quot;每细胞每基因转录本数&quot;而非严格 UMI，方差结构偏离负二项假设更多，套用 <code>pearson_residuals</code> 前应先做经验验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>归一化与高变基因选择是单细胞管线中&quot;决定上限&quot;的一步，可归纳为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三条技术噪声</strong>（测序深度、捕获效率、组成偏差）需分别处理，<code>exclude_highly_expressed</code> 处理第三类。</li>\n<li><strong>两条路线并存</strong>：深度归一化 + log1p 简单快速但方差结构被近似抹平；负二项建模 + 皮尔逊残差显式建模方差但计算更重、API 更易变。</li>\n<li><strong>输入类型是 flavor 的第一约束</strong>：<code>seurat</code>/<code>cell_ranger</code> 吃对数化数据，<code>seurat_v3</code>/<code>pearson_residuals</code> 吃原始计数，混淆二者是最常见的管线错误。</li>\n<li><strong>解析皮尔逊残差</strong>（Lause 等 2021，<em>Genome Biology</em> 22:296）用共享 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 换速度，默认裁剪到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>obs</mtext></msub></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm\\sqrt{n_{\\text{obs}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.3147em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">obs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.6853em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3147em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，是大规模图谱首选。</li>\n<li><strong>SCTransform v2</strong>（Hafemeister &amp; Satija 2019；Seurat 5.x 默认）用逐基因正则化负二项，默认 3000 个 HVG，是 R 生态对应方案。</li>\n<li><strong>样本数 ≥2 就传 <code>batch_key</code></strong>；<code>seurat_v3_paper</code> 是专为多批次整合设计的选择策略。</li>\n<li><strong>方法必须在项目内固定</strong>：不同 flavor 的 HVG 重叠率仅约 60–70%，混用会让跨数据集比较失去可比性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"归一化、方差稳定与高变基因选择","id":"归一化-方差稳定与高变基因选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测序深度归一化与对数变换","id":"测序深度归一化与对数变换"},{"level":2,"text":"方差稳定与解析皮尔逊残差","id":"方差稳定与解析皮尔逊残差"},{"level":2,"text":"高变基因选择的四种 flavor","id":"高变基因选择的四种-flavor"},{"level":2,"text":"批次感知的 HVG 与稳健性实践","id":"批次感知的-hvg-与稳健性实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"细胞质控、双细胞与环境 RNA 诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/singlecell-assay-data-model/quality-control-batch-diagnosis"},"next":{"title":"降维与图聚类算法机制（PCA/UMAP/Leiden）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/preprocessing-annotation-pipeline/dimred-clustering-algorithms"}}